              ms_kat.LICENSE.TXT is a verbatim copy of llvm/LICENSE.TXT at that tag
              (15141 bytes, SHA-256 8d85c1057d742e597985c7d4e6320b015a9139385cff4cbae06ffc0ebe89afee).
Copyright:    the test files carry no copyright, licence or SPDX header. The LLVM licence file names no
              holder beyond the Apache boilerplate, so the work is attributed to "the LLVM Project".
NOTICE file:  the upstream repository has no NOTICE file at that tag (HTTP 404 for /NOTICE and /llvm/NOTICE).
Third party:  the LLVM licence says third-party code inside the project sits in a directory with its own
              licence file or carries terms at the top of every file. Neither applies here: HTTP 404 for
              llvm/test/Demangle/LICENSE, llvm/test/Demangle/LICENSE.TXT and llvm/test/LICENSE.TXT, and the
              13 files below hold no licence text. Several are marked "based on" clang/test/CodeGenCXX/
              mangle-ms*.cpp, which is the same project and licence.

Changes made (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): ms_kat.tsv is a MODIFIED derivative, not a copy.
  - 59 of the 1,106 inputs in the 18 ms-*.test files at that tag were selected by hand (the 13 files below
    supplied them) to cover simple names, constructors, destructors, scope back-references, operators,
    special names, templates, local and anonymous scopes, names ending in digits, string literals and RTTI.
  - The mangled column is copied from the test inputs. The demangled column is NOT the FileCheck text
    (a FileCheck line is only a substring of the real output): it is the full output of LLVM's Microsoft
    demangler, produced and checked with pydemumble 0.1.3 in a scratch virtual environment. pydemumble is a
    BSD-2-Clause wrapper that bundles LLVM's MicrosoftDemangle.cpp under the licence above. It is not a
    dependency of this repository and none of its code is copied here.
  - The columns kind, qualified_name, tail and complex and the row selection are PatchTrace's own work
    (project licence); qualified_name is the decoder's own rendering of each name, see the file header.
  - The source column gives file:line of the input in the tests. Format: tab separated values with comments.
  This file is test data only: the repository build scripts do not collect tests/.

